<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:46:26 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>中国回击特朗普新关税前景</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/the-pulse-11-25-2026-video</link><description>中国称美国对其出口征收新关税的前景是“政治操纵”，并表示两国应共同努力维持贸易休战。黄仁勋在重新担任英伟达首席执行官后的第二天，语气忧郁，在一次全体会议上向员工道歉，并表示他一直在接受日常治疗，以解决导致他短暂被免职的行为。随着对人工智能行业前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售并未显示出停止的迹象。今天的嘉宾：高盛资产配置研究主管 Christian Mueller-Glissman；傅晓兰，牛津大学技术与国际发展教授兼技术与工业化发展中心创始主任； Caitlin Egen，控制风险数字风险总监。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/the-pulse-11-25-2026-video'&gt;中国回击特朗普新关税前景&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China Hits Back at New Trump Tariff Prospects&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/the-pulse-11-25-2026-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:51:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</link><description>由于科技股再度下跌，削弱了投资者对风险资产的兴趣，美国国债周三全线上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment'&gt;科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Rally as Tech Stock Losses Dent Risk Appetite&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:49:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Advent 考虑收购测试公司 Bureau Veritas</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas</link><description>据知情人士透露，Advent 正在考虑收购法国测试公司 Bureau Veritas SA，这将是今年欧洲公司最大的收购之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas'&gt;Advent 考虑收购测试公司 Bureau Veritas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Advent Weighs Takeover Of Testing Firm Bureau Veritas&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:58:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>随着对人工智能行业前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售没有显示出停止的迹象，投资者转向债券寻求安全。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Tech Selloff Rolls On as Haven Demand Lifts Bonds: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</link><description>黄金下跌，因为股市继续抛售，投资者等待关键的通胀数据，这可能会影响美联储进一步加息的预期。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets'&gt;通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Declines Ahead of Inflation Data That Will Guide Fed Bets&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:51:22 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>